          <td>Marketing preferences</td>
          <td>
            Until you unsubscribe. We then keep a short record so we do not email you again
          </td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Security and server logs</td>
          <td>Up to 12 months</td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
          <td>Analytics</td>
          <td>
            For as long as the analytics tool is configured to retain it, and only while it is useful
          </td>
        </tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>
